/summer cb-season
330 cb-psky
-9 621 330 64 cb-ptreeline
330 cb-pwater
-10 620 332 cb-pmist
newpath 400 140 moveto 560 170 lineto 400 150 moveto 560 120 lineto /glint cb-pc cb-rgb << /Width 2 /Taper 0.8 >> pkliner
/cb-dkgrow 0 def 340 140 112 cb-duckling
140 220 110 cb-pduck 210 214 30 cb-pchick 240 220 28 cb-pchick
-9 120 260 26 cb-preeds 540 621 240 20 cb-preeds
cb-ink cb-rgb
(At last it did. Out tumbled a duckling who was big, and grey, and not like the others at all. \252Never mind,\272 said his mother. \252Look how well he swims.\272) 50 590 512 /center cb-text pop
3 cb-folio
showpage
